    "Item definitions. This file is content, not code: editing it and restarting the",
    "game server is the whole deployment. No rebuild, no sgl tag, no package bump.",
    "",
    "id is permanent. Inventories and loot tables store the id and nothing else, so",
    "renaming an id silently repoints every saved copy of that item. Renaming 'name'",
    "is always safe.",
    "",
    "Rules enforced at boot by Shared.GameLogic/Content/ContentValidation.cs — the",
    "server refuses to start rather than run on content it cannot vouch for:",
    "  - ids are lowercase letters, digits and underscore, unique, <= 64 chars",
    "  - stackMax >= 1, and exactly 1 for anything with a slot",
    "  - no negative stats",
    "slot:   none | weapon | head | chest | legs | trinket",
